# Environment for deploying the telemetry receiver. From telemetry/worker/:
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# wrangler loads .env from this folder by itself, so nothing else is needed.
# Both variables are optional: after `npx wrangler login`, wrangler uses your
# browser login and the account_id in wrangler.toml, so both stay commented
# out until you need them: an empty `NAME=` would still be set. .env is
# gitignored; never commit a real token.

# An API token, for deploying without a browser login (CI, a server, another
# machine). Create it at https://dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens with
# the "Edit Cloudflare Workers" template plus D1 Edit permission.
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=

# Overrides account_id in wrangler.toml. Leave commented out to use that one.
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=
